finding td-applyedit-schema-omits-change-kind High: apply-edit's canonical capability schema never declares `change_kind`, so targeted edits are unreachable through the validated loop
finding td-worker-instruction-never-emitted High: The targeted-edit worker instruction and its size threshold have no consumer anywhere in the change
finding td-unified-diff-substring-anchor Medium: Line-oriented unified-diff hunks are matched as bare substrings, so a diverged file can be silently misapplied
finding td-journal-not-lossless Medium: Only the bounded window is hashed into the journal; the full output is retained outside any evidence store
finding td-migration-57-gap-fill-untested Medium: No test covers applying migration 57 to a database already migrated through 58
finding td-retention-shared-temp-residual Medium: Retained tool output still sits under an attacker-influenceable shared-temp parent and is never removed
finding td-search-list-unbounded Low: `search-list` results are not bounded, so one tool result class still returns unbounded text to the model
finding td-handle-path-traversal High: Prior finding: paging-handle path traversal in read-file
finding td-retention-tempdir-exposure High: Prior finding: retained tool output exposed in the shared temp directory
